  "kind": "table",
  "label": "Table 4",
  "title": "Table 4. Considerations for transition to optimal ART regimens for children who are considered stable on ART based on national guidelines",
  "file": "../tables/table-4.csv",
  "headers": [
    "Current regimen",
    "Weight",
    "Optimal regimen for transition",
    "Considerations"
  ],
  "pageStart": 12,
  "pageEnd": 12,
  "narrative": [
    {
      "text": "For children considered stable on ART, the table gives, by current regimen and weight band (<20 kg, 20–30 kg, >30 kg), the optimal regimen to transition to and related considerations.",
      "lang": "en",
      "state": "draft",
      "drafted_by": {
        "kind": "agent",
        "id": "claude-code",
        "model": "not-disclosed",
        "session": "https://claude.ai/code/session_01Qmmkt7LJVddPRBy6F6BnEb"
      },
      "drafted_at": "2026-11-11"
    },
    {
      "text": "يعرض الجدول، للأطفال الذين يُعتبرون مستقرين على العلاج المضاد للفيروسات القهقرية، النظام الأمثل الذي ينبغي الانتقال إليه والاعتبارات ذات الصلة، بحسب النظام الحالي وفئة الوزن (أقل من 20 كغ، و20–30 كغ، وأكثر من 30 كغ).",
      "lang": "ar",
      "state": "draft",
      "drafted_by": {
        "kind": "agent",
        "id": "claude-code",
        "model": "not-disclosed",
        "session": "https://claude.ai/code/session_01Qmmkt7LJVddPRBy6F6BnEb"
      },
      "drafted_at": "2026-11-11"
    },
    {
      "text": "该表针对被认为抗逆转录病毒治疗稳定的儿童，按当前方案和体重段（<20公斤、20–30公斤、>30公斤）列出应过渡到的最佳方案及相关考虑。",
      "lang": "zh",
      "state": "draft",
      "drafted_by": {
        "kind": "agent",
        "id": "claude-code",
        "model": "not-disclosed",
        "session": "https://claude.ai/code/session_01Qmmkt7LJVddPRBy6F6BnEb"
      },
      "drafted_at": "2026-11-11"
    },
    {
      "text": "Para los niños considerados estables con TAR, el cuadro indica, según el esquema actual y la franja de peso (<20 kg, 20-30 kg, >30 kg), el esquema óptimo al que realizar la transición y las consideraciones correspondientes.",
      "lang": "es",
      "state": "draft",
      "drafted_by": {
        "kind": "agent",
        "id": "claude-code",
        "model": "not-disclosed",
        "session": "https://claude.ai/code/session_01Qmmkt7LJVddPRBy6F6BnEb"
      },
      "drafted_at": "2026-11-11"
    },
    {
      "text": "Pour les enfants considérés comme stables sous TAR, le tableau indique, selon le schéma actuel et la tranche de poids (<20 kg, 20-30 kg, >30 kg), le schéma optimal vers lequel effectuer la transition et les considérations correspondantes.",
      "lang": "fr",
      "state": "draft",
      "drafted_by": {
        "kind": "agent",
        "id": "claude-code",
        "model": "not-disclosed",
        "session": "https://claude.ai/code/session_01Qmmkt7LJVddPRBy6F6BnEb"
      },
      "drafted_at": "2026-11-11"
    },
    {
      "text": "Для детей, считающихся стабильными на АРТ, в таблице указаны в зависимости от текущей схемы и весовой категории (<20 кг, 20–30 кг, >30 кг) оптимальная схема для перехода и соответствующие соображения.",
      "lang": "ru",
      "state": "draft",
      "drafted_by": {
        "kind": "agent",
        "id": "claude-code",
        "model": "not-disclosed",
        "session": "https://claude.ai/code/session_01Qmmkt7LJVddPRBy6F6BnEb"
      },
      "drafted_at": "2026-11-11"
    }
